OL,3,GNEWSAFare dodger who punched PC laughs 
OL,4,Ain police video                        
OL,6,FA fare evader who punched a police     
OL,7,Fofficer in the face causing him serious
OL,8,Ffacial injuries and later laughed about
OL,9,Fit has been remanded in custody as he  
OL,10,Fawaits sentencing.                     
OL,12,FShemar Robinson, 24, was caught on     
OL,13,Fbody-worn camera assaulting the Met    
OL,14,FPolice constable as he was confronted  
OL,15,Ffor pushing through barriers at Dollis 
OL,16,FHill Underground station in north-west 
OL,17,FLondon on Thursday.                    
