OL,3,GNEWSAFare dodger who punched PC laughs 
OL,4,Ain police video                        
OL,6,FThe punch was so hard the impact can be
OL,7,Fheard in the video and Robinson was    
OL,8,Fleft with the officer's teeth marks in 
OL,9,Fhis fist. He later told police he had  
OL,10,F"no remorse" about the assault.        
OL,12,FRobinson was charged with causing      
OL,13,Fgrievous bodily harm, possession of a  
OL,14,FClass B drug and fare evasion, pleading
OL,15,Fguilty to each offence.                
